@inherits LayoutComponentBase

@*
    The study view owns the whole screen: no sidebar, no top bar, no tab bar.

    This is a layout rather than a flag on a shared service. An earlier version
    had MainLayout hide its chrome when AppState.Immersive was set, but that
    depends on the page's OnInitialized running before the layout's render —
    a race the layout lost, so the shell stayed on screen behind the session.
    Choosing the layout per page is decided at routing time and cannot race.
*@

@Body
